---
// Landing page — entry point for the RPG authoring tool.
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; connect-src 'self'; font-src 'self' data:" />
  <title>RPG Storyboard — Quest Authoring Tool</title>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html, body { min-height: 100vh; }
    body {
      background: #0b1120;
      color: #f1f5f9;
      font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    }

    /* ─── Focus polish ─── */
    a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible,
    [role="button"]:focus-visible, [tabindex]:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid #94a3b8;
      outline-offset: 2px;
      border-radius: 3px;
    }

    .page {
      flex: 1;
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 80px 24px 80px;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;
    }

    .label {
      font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 36px; font-weight: 800; color: #f1f5f9;
      line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .subtitle {
      font-size: 15px; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 48px; max-width: 520px;
    }

    .entry-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 680px) {
      .entry-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 440px) {
      .entry-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    .entry-card {
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      background: #0f1825;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: border-color 0.15s;
    }
    .entry-card:hover { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.18); }
    .entry-card-label {
      font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase; color: #334155;
    }
    .entry-card-title {
      font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #f1f5f9;
    }
    .entry-card-desc {
      font-size: 12px; color: #475569; line-height: 1.55;
    }
    .entry-card-cta {
      font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .what-is {
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      padding-top: 32px;
    }
    .what-is-title {
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #334155;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .what-is-list {
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;
      list-style: none;
    }
    .what-is-item {
      font-size: 12px; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;
      display: flex; gap: 8px;
    }
    .what-is-bullet { color: #1e293b; flex-shrink: 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="page">

    <p class="label">RPG Storyboard OS</p>
    <h1>Quest authoring<br />for implementers</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">
      Design RPG quest structure as a visual board. Every beat carries
      entry conditions, state changes, required assets, and test criteria —
      ready to hand off to an engine or dev pass.
    </p>

    <div class="entry-grid">
      <a href="/storyboards/quest-01" class="entry-card">
        <span class="entry-card-label">Demo Quest</span>
        <span class="entry-card-title">The Tollhouse Ledger</span>
        <span class="entry-card-desc">
          Three factions, one ledger, two consequence paths.
          Eight beats. Fully specced.
        </span>
        <span class="entry-card-cta">Open board →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/templates" class="entry-card">
        <span class="entry-card-label">Templates</span>
        <span class="entry-card-title">Quest Templates</span>
        <span class="entry-card-desc">
          Three RPG authoring starting points — quest flow,
          branching choice, and cutscene beat.
        </span>
        <span class="entry-card-cta">Browse templates →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/projects" class="entry-card">
        <span class="entry-card-label">Projects</span>
        <span class="entry-card-title">Your Projects</span>
        <span class="entry-card-desc">
          Projects created from templates. Saved in this browser,
          ready to open and author.
        </span>
        <span class="entry-card-cta">Open projects →</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="what-is">
      <p class="what-is-title">What this is</p>
      <ul class="what-is-list">
        <li class="what-is-item">
          <span class="what-is-bullet">–</span>
          <span>A visual canvas that shows quest flow and game-state branch logic side by side</span>
        </li>
        <li class="what-is-item">
          <span class="what-is-bullet">–</span>
          <span>Beat pages that are implementation specs — not story notes</span>
        </li>
        <li class="what-is-item">
          <span class="what-is-bullet">–</span>
          <span>A handoff export a developer can implement from without reverse-engineering the board</span>
        </li>
        <li class="what-is-item">
          <span class="what-is-bullet">–</span>
          <span>Not a tabletop tool. Not a campaign manager. Not a GM aid.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

  </main>
</body>
</html>
